Phase 5: Learn AI-Assisted Development (Modern Professional Workflow)

Use AI to:

Explain concepts
Generate examples
Review code
Debug errors
Create project plans
Write tests
Improve documentation

But always:

Write code yourself first.
Ask AI to review afterward.
Understand every line before using it.

A good prompt:

"Don't give me the answer. Guide me step by step and ask questions until I solve it."

